# Ignore all temporary build configurations generated by Unreal Engine 5
**/Intermediate/
**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/
**/.vs/
**/*.xcworkspace/
**/DerivedData/
# Ignore macOS administrative metadata files
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Ignore all C++ CMake build caches and binaries
**/build/
**/cmake-build-debug/
**/cmake-build-release/
C++/OPENGLexperiment/build/
